PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Smooth Side
    - Manifolds M and N
    - Smooth maps shown normally
  L2: Discrete Side
    - Graphs F(M) and F(N)
    - A graph morphism φ: F(M) → F(N) drawn in red (#FF0000FF)
  L3: Missing Preimage Indicator
    - Dashed arrow on smooth side showing "no corresponding morphism"
  L4: Labels
    - "Non-Full"
    - "φ ∈ Hom_Discrete(F(M), F(N))"
    - "No f such that F(f) = φ"
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Red dashed boundary around φ

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
